{"title":"Career Roadmap · Health Information Manager","role":"Health Information Manager","summary":"A Health Information Manager (HIM) manages the collection, organization, quality, security, storage, retrieval, and appropriate use of health information. The role sits at the intersection of healthcare, medical records, data management, information systems, privacy, coding, analytics, and healthcare administration.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Health Information Manager (HIM) manages the collection, organization, quality, security, storage, retrieval, and appropriate use of health information. The role sits at the intersection of healthcare, medical records, data management, information systems, privacy, coding, analytics, and healthcare administration."},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the direct academic pathway is a Bachelor's program in Health Information Management, Medical Records Technology/Management, Health Information Management, or an equivalent recognized healthcare-information program. The broad allied-health category should not be interpreted as meaning that every BPT, BOT, or BMLT graduate automatically qualifies for HIM roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information Managers can work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Medical colleges"},{"text":"Health systems"},{"text":"Insurance organizations"},{"text":"Healthcare IT companies"},{"text":"Medical-record departments"},{"text":"Clinical research organizations"},{"text":"Health-data organizations"},{"text":"Public-health institutions"},{"text":"Health-information exchanges"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build medical-record, coding, health-data and healthcare-information-system skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as Health Information Executive/Officer, Medical Records Officer or HIM Associate"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward HIM Specialist, Data Quality Lead, Coding Lead or Health Information Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into HIM leadership, clinical informatics, healthcare analytics, privacy, data governance or digital-health management"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the UG Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Healthcare & Information Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human anatomy"},{"text":"Human physiology"},{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Basic pathology"},{"text":"Pharmacology fundamentals"},{"text":"Healthcare delivery systems"},{"text":"Hospital organization"},{"text":"Healthcare ethics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Health information fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical records"},{"text":"Patient files"},{"text":"Clinical documentation"},{"text":"Registration systems"},{"text":"Discharge summaries"},{"text":"Diagnostic reports"},{"text":"Consent documentation"},{"text":"Health-information lifecycle"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic workflow:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Encounter"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Record"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Validation"},{"type":"h","text":"Storage / EHR"},{"type":"h","text":"Retrieval"},{"type":"h","text":"Reporting / Authorized Use"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Medical Records & Coding"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical knowledge of health information management."},{"type":"h","text":"Medical records"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to manage:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Outpatient records"},{"text":"Inpatient records"},{"text":"Emergency records"},{"text":"Surgical records"},{"text":"Laboratory reports"},{"text":"Imaging reports"},{"text":"Discharge summaries"},{"text":"Referral records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Medical terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"Build vocabulary around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Body systems"},{"text":"Diseases"},{"text":"Procedures"},{"text":"Medications"},{"text":"Investigations"},{"text":"Surgical terminology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Classification & coding"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the principles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ICD-based disease classification"},{"text":"Procedure classification"},{"text":"Diagnosis coding"},{"text":"Clinical terminology systems"},{"text":"Coding quality checks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Specific coding systems and their use depend on the employer, payer, country and healthcare setting."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Health Information Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should transition from traditional medical records to digital health information management."},{"type":"h","text":"EHR/HIS"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electronic Health Records"},{"text":"Hospital Information Systems"},{"text":"Laboratory Information Systems"},{"text":"Radiology Information Systems"},{"text":"Pharmacy information systems"},{"text":"Patient portals"},{"text":"Health information exchange"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient"},{"type":"h","text":"Registration"},{"type":"h","text":"EHR"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Clinical Notes"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Laboratory"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Pharmacy"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information Repository"},{"type":"h","text":"Authorized Users"},{"type":"h","text":"Data quality"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing information"},{"text":"Duplicate records"},{"text":"Incorrect patient identifiers"},{"text":"Inconsistent terminology"},{"text":"Invalid values"},{"text":"Documentation gaps"},{"text":"Data-entry errors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — HIM Operations, Analytics & Governance"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop management-level skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Health-information operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Record retention"},{"text":"Record retrieval"},{"text":"Release of information"},{"text":"Documentation audits"},{"text":"Data quality management"},{"text":"Information governance"},{"text":"Health-data security"},{"text":"Access control"},{"text":"Privacy principles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Healthcare KPIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Team coordination"},{"text":"SOP development"},{"text":"Process improvement"},{"text":"Quality assurance"},{"text":"Audit preparation"},{"text":"Incident management"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Health Information Skill Stack"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Medical Records"},{"text":"Creation, maintenance, retrieval"}],[{"text":"Medical Terminology"},{"text":"Clinical vocabulary"}],[{"text":"Coding"},{"text":"Diagnosis/procedure classification"}],[{"text":"EHR"},{"text":"Electronic health-record workflows"}],[{"text":"Data Quality"},{"text":"Validation and auditing"}],[{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Confidentiality and authorized access"}],[{"text":"Information Governance"},{"text":"Policies and controls"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Healthcare KPI analysis"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data querying"}],[{"text":"BI"},{"text":"Power BI dashboards"}],[{"text":"Administration"},{"text":"HIM operations"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Clinical record standards"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Coding & Classification"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong HIM professional should understand the structure of medical coding."},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Encounter"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnosis / Procedure Identification"},{"type":"h","text":"Code Assignment"},{"type":"h","text":"Coding Validation"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Quality Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Reporting / Billing / Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"The HIM professional must avoid assigning unsupported codes merely because a diagnosis appears likely. Coding should be grounded in appropriate clinical documentation and applicable coding guidelines."},{"type":"h","text":"Data Quality Management"},{"type":"p","text":"One of the most important HIM capabilities is ensuring that health information is:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accurate"},{"text":"Complete"},{"text":"Consistent"},{"text":"Timely"},{"text":"Accessible to authorized users"},{"text":"Secure"},{"text":"Traceable"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data-quality workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Raw Health Data"},{"type":"h","text":"Validation"},{"type":"h","text":"Duplicate Check"},{"type":"h","text":"Completeness Check"},{"type":"h","text":"Consistency Check"},{"type":"h","text":"Error Correction"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality Approval"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics / Reporting"},{"type":"h","text":"Privacy & Security"},{"type":"p","text":"Health information is highly sensitive."},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Consent"},{"text":"Role-based access"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Audit trails"},{"text":"Data minimization"},{"text":"Secure information sharing"},{"text":"Retention policies"},{"text":"Data breach response"},{"text":"Cybersecurity fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact privacy and health-data requirements depend on the jurisdiction and healthcare organization."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Health Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern HIM professionals should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EHR"},{"text":"HIS"},{"text":"LIS"},{"text":"RIS"},{"text":"PACS"},{"text":"Pharmacy systems"},{"text":"Patient portals"},{"text":"Interoperability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Standards & interoperability"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HL7"},{"text":"FHIR"},{"text":"DICOM"},{"text":"Clinical terminology standards"},{"text":"Structured health data"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes particularly valuable when moving into healthcare IT and clinical informatics."},{"type":"h","text":"Data & Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Conditional logic"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Dashboard creation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"h","text":"department,"},{"type":"h","text":"COUNT(*) AS encounters"},{"type":"h","text":"FROM patient_records"},{"type":"h","text":"GROUP BY department;"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Build dashboards for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient volume"},{"text":"Department performance"},{"text":"Record completion"},{"text":"Coding accuracy"},{"text":"Data-quality metrics"},{"text":"Length of stay"},{"text":"Readmission trends"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Health Information Management"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly affect HIM operations."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical NLP"},{"text":"Automated medical coding"},{"text":"Clinical-document classification"},{"text":"Data-quality automation"},{"text":"Duplicate-record detection"},{"text":"Medical-record summarization"},{"text":"Information retrieval"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"AI governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"NLP / AI Processing"},{"type":"h","text":"Structured Information"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Validation"},{"type":"h","text":"EHR / HIM System"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"The HIM professional remains important for validation, governance, privacy, data quality and responsible information use."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Hospital EHR Prototype"},{"type":"h","text":"Create a simplified system for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient registration"},{"text":"Medical records"},{"text":"Diagnoses"},{"text":"Investigations"},{"text":"Discharge records"},{"text":"User access control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Medical Record Quality Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing fields"},{"text":"Duplicate records"},{"text":"Record completion"},{"text":"Documentation delays"},{"text":"Department-level quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Healthcare Data Warehouse"},{"type":"h","text":"Create a structured healthcare database:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient"},{"type":"h","text":"Encounter"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Diagnosis"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Procedure"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Laboratory"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Medication"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Billing"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Warehouse"},{"type":"h","text":"BI Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Medical Coding Quality Tool"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a prototype that:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accepts structured clinical documentation"},{"text":"Maps terms to candidate codes"},{"text":"Flags missing information"},{"text":"Generates a coding-quality report"}]},{"type":"p","text":"It should be positioned as coding assistance, not autonomous final coding."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — End-to-End HIM Platform"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Registration"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Encounter"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Quality"},{"type":"h","text":"Privacy / Access Control"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Management Dashboard"}]},{"heading":"Hospital Medical Records Department","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Record creation"},{"text":"Record indexing"},{"text":"Record retrieval"},{"text":"Discharge documentation"},{"text":"Record audits"}]}]},{"heading":"Health Information Department","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data-quality workflows"},{"text":"Coding"},{"text":"Documentation review"},{"text":"Release-of-information processes"}]}]},{"heading":"Hospital IT Department","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HIS"},{"text":"EHR"},{"text":"User access"},{"text":"System workflows"},{"text":"Healthcare interoperability"}]}]},{"heading":"Healthcare Analytics Company","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Healthcare datasets"},{"text":"KPI reporting"}]}]},{"heading":"Health-Tech Company","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital health"},{"text":"EHR products"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Interoperability"},{"text":"Product implementation"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Health Information Executive"},{"text":"Health Information Associate"},{"text":"Medical Records Officer"},{"text":"Medical Records Executive"},{"text":"Health Information Technician"},{"text":"Medical Coding Associate"},{"text":"Clinical Documentation Associate"},{"text":"HIM Quality Associate"},{"text":"EHR Data Associate"},{"text":"Healthcare Data Analyst"},{"text":"Health Information Coordinator"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Hospital"},{"text":"Medical records + EHR"}],[{"text":"Medical College"},{"text":"Documentation + records"}],[{"text":"Health-Tech Company"},{"text":"EHR + interoperability"}],[{"text":"Healthcare Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + BI"}],[{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Coding + claims data"}],[{"text":"Clinical Research Organization"},{"text":"Clinical data + documentation"}],[{"text":"Government Health System"},{"text":"Data + reporting"}],[{"text":"Diagnostic Network"},{"text":"Health information systems"}],[{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Analytics + process improvement"}],[{"text":"Digital Health Startup"},{"text":"EHR + product + data"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"HIM / Clinical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Medical coding"},{"text":"Clinical documentation"},{"text":"Health information management"},{"text":"Healthcare quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Database fundamentals"},{"text":"Healthcare analytics"},{"text":"Health informatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interoperability"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HL7"},{"text":"FHIR"},{"text":"DICOM"},{"text":"Healthcare APIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Security"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information security"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Access control"},{"text":"Cybersecurity fundamentals"},{"text":"Data governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should be selected according to the employer and the applicable Indian/international HIM or coding framework rather than collected solely for their certificate value."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Master's in Health Information Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Best for progressing within HIM operations."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Master's in Health Informatics"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EHR"},{"text":"Healthcare IT"},{"text":"Interoperability"},{"text":"Digital health"},{"text":"Clinical informatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Master's in Hospital Administration"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospital operations"},{"text":"Healthcare management"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Master's in Healthcare Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Healthcare intelligence"},{"text":"Population health"},{"text":"Business intelligence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. MBA Healthcare Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful for moving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthcare operations"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Health Information Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HIM operations"},{"text":"Records"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Clinical Documentation Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Documentation quality"},{"text":"Clinical records"},{"text":"Coding support"},{"text":"Audit"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Medical Coding Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diagnosis coding"},{"text":"Procedure coding"},{"text":"Coding quality"},{"text":"Compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Clinical Informatics Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EHR"},{"text":"Clinical workflows"},{"text":"Interoperability"},{"text":"Digital transformation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Healthcare Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"BI"},{"text":"Healthcare KPIs"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Health Data Governance Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Metadata"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"HIM / Medical Records UG"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior HIM Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"HIM / Clinical Informatics Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Director — Health Information / Informatics"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information Graduate"},{"type":"h","text":"EHR / Health Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Informatics Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Informatics Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Informatics Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Health / Informatics Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Data pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"HIM"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Analytics Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Data / BI Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"The HIM profession is rapidly moving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted medical coding"},{"text":"Clinical NLP"},{"text":"Automated documentation"},{"text":"FHIR-based interoperability"},{"text":"Healthcare data warehouses"},{"text":"Cloud EHR systems"},{"text":"Data governance platforms"},{"text":"Privacy-enhancing technologies"},{"text":"Healthcare cybersecurity"},{"text":"Population-health analytics"},{"text":"Digital health platforms"},{"text":"Generative AI for health information workflows"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future-facing combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Health Information Management","EHR","Interoperability","Data Analytics","AI Governance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Medical Terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Healthcare Systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Information"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Medical Records"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Data Quality"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Record Management"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Information Governance"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"├── EHR / HIS"},{"type":"h","text":"├── HL7"},{"type":"h","text":"├── FHIR"},{"type":"h","text":"├── DICOM"},{"type":"h","text":"├── SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Data & AI"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Healthcare Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Data Visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Clinical NLP"},{"type":"h","text":"├── AI-Assisted Coding"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Data Governance"},{"type":"h","text":"└── AI Governance"},{"type":"h","text":"Security"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Privacy"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Access Control"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Audit Trails"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Cybersecurity"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Data Protection"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Quality Management"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Process Improvement"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manage medical-record workflows."},{"text":"Understand healthcare documentation standards."},{"text":"Apply medical terminology accurately."},{"text":"Understand the principles of diagnosis and procedure coding."},{"text":"Perform basic health-information quality audits."},{"text":"Work with EHR/HIS platforms."},{"text":"Understand healthcare interoperability concepts."},{"text":"Use Excel confidently for health-data management."},{"text":"Query basic healthcare databases using SQL."},{"text":"Build healthcare dashboards using Power BI."},{"text":"Understand privacy, confidentiality and access control."},{"text":"Understand HL7, FHIR and DICOM fundamentals."},{"text":"Identify common health-data quality problems."},{"text":"Prepare HIM reports and operational dashboards."},{"text":"Understand basic clinical documentation and coding workflows."},{"text":"Apply responsible AI principles to healthcare information management."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Health Information Management / Medical Records UG","Health Information Associate","Health Information Officer","Health Information Manager","Clinical Informatics / Data Governance / Healthcare Analytics Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the 2026+ healthcare environment, the strongest profile is a Health Information Manager who combines traditional medical-record expertise with EHR systems, interoperability, SQL/BI, data governance, privacy and AI-enabled healthcare information management."}]}]}